<topic template="Default" modified="2024-12-11T15:46:19.190+01:00" lasteditedby="Eva" version="2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title>CLEAR SCREEN Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>CLEAR SCREEN Command</keyword>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>Terminal Window</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">CLEAR SCREEN Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Purpose</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">Clears the screen and positions the cursor in the top left corner.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Syntax</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text style="font-family:Consolas;">CLEAR SCREEN</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Description</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text">The command CLEAR SCREEN erases the screen. <br/>After execution of the command, the cursor is positioned at 0, 0 and the functions Row() and Col() are updated. The command is translated by the preprocessor to a call to <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\M_XSharp_RT_Functions_Cls.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">Cls()</link> followed by a call to <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\M_XSharp_RT_Functions_SetPos.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetPos()</link>(0,0).</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Examples</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">This example clears the screen after setting the colors:</para>
    <para styleclass="Code Example"><text style="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; color:#ff0000;">FUNCTION</text><text style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; color:#000000;"> Start </text><text style="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; color:#ff0000;">AS</text><text style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; color:#000000;">&#32;</text><text style="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; color:#ff0000;">VOID</text><br/><text style="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; color:#ff0000;">SET</text><text style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; color:#000000;">&#32;</text><text style="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; color:#ff0000;">COLOR</text><text style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; color:#000000;">&#32;</text><text style="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; color:#ff0000;">TO</text><text style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; color:#000000;"> gr+/B &#160;</text><text style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic; text-decoration:none; color:#339966;">// Yellow on Blue</text><br/><text style="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; color:#ff0000;">CLEAR</text><text style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; color:#000000;">&#32;</text><text style="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; color:#ff0000;">SCREEN</text><br/><text style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:none; color:#000000;">? &quot;Hello world&quot;</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__IncludeLibRT" inline="false"/></para>
  </body>
